{"meta":{"id":"create-table","category":"it/syntax/mysql/table","title":"create table · 키 · 기본값 · MySQL","subtitle":"(MYSQL)","summary":"auto_increment · primary key · unique · foreign key, 복합키, default current_timestamp, 자주 쓰는 타입","tags":["mysql","db","f-types"],"color":"teal","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-teal","source":"언어별사용 정리.xlsx","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-teal-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-teal-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-teal-50 text-teal-700 border border-teal-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></span>MYSQL</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">create table · 키 · 기본값 · MySQL</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-teal-50/70 border border-teal-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-teal-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> auto_increment · primary key · unique · foreign key, 복합키, default current_timestamp, 자주 쓰는 타입</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">create table</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">sql</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">create table member (\r\n  idx       int not null auto_increment primary key,   -- 자동 증가 기본키\r\n  mid       varchar(20) not null unique,               -- 중복 불가\r\n  pwd       varchar(100) not null,\r\n  name      varchar(20) not null,\r\n  point     int default 0,\r\n  joinDate  timestamp default current_timestamp        -- 생성 시 현재 시간\r\n);\r\n\r\n-- 기본키를 여러 컬럼으로 (복합키): 컬럼 정의 뒤에 따로 선언\r\ncreate table member_role (\r\n  mid   varchar(20) not null,\r\n  role  varchar(20) not null,\r\n  primary key (mid, role),\r\n  foreign key (mid) references member(mid) on delete cascade\r\n);</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">키 · 속성</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">키워드</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">의미</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>primary key</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">기본키 — null 불가 + 중복 불가, 테이블당 하나 (여러 컬럼 묶기 가능)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>foreign key</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">외래키 — 다른 테이블의 키를 참조</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>unique</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">중복 방지키 — null 은 허용</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>auto_increment</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">번호 자동 증가</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>default current_timestamp</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">값을 안 넣으면 현재 시간</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">자주 쓰는 타입</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">타입</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">용도</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>int / bigint</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">정수</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>decimal(10,2)</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">금액 등 정확한 소수</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>varchar(n)</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">가변 길이 문자열</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>text</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">긴 글 (게시글 내용)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>datetime / timestamp</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">날짜 · 시간 (timestamp 는 시간대 변환)</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> Java › 기본 타입 (DB 타입 ↔ Java 타입), 서버 › 백엔드 › DB insert</p>","path":"it/syntax/mysql/table/create-table","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"mysql","title":"MYSQL","path":"it/syntax/mysql"},{"id":"table","title":"테이블","path":"it/syntax/mysql/table"}],"hasImage":false}